{
  "title": "Exquisite Easy Filipino Beef Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and flavorful Filipino dish featuring beef, tomatoes, and confit-tomato, perfect for a hangover cure or a low-calorie meal.",
  "cuisine": "Filipino",
